  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the yakimono grill to medium-high heat.",
    "Season the cod fish with salt and pepper.",
    "Brush the grill with olive oil and cook the fish for 4 minutes per side.",
    "In a small bowl, whisk together soy sauce and 1 tablespoon of water.",
    "Add the sliced zucchini and carrots to the grill and cook for 3 minutes.",
    "In a large dolsot stone bowl, combine cooked brown rice, grilled vegetables, and grilled fish.",
    "Drizzle the soy sauce mixture over the top of the dish.",
    "Sprinkle chopped green onions and sesame seeds over the top.",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy."
